      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046781">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046783">AVX512_FP16</para>
      <para unique="1046784">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+560181"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046786">Multiply packed FP16 values from zmm1 and zmm3/m512/m16bcst, subtract/add elements in zmm2, and store the result in zmm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td><para unique="1046765">EVEX.128.66.MAP6.W0 A7 /r</para>
      <para unique="1046766">VFMSUBADD213PH xmm1{k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m128/m16bcst</para>
